# Temple Bells, by Claude & SZ. An original ambient piece for the Ambient style, after the temple
# mood in the Pagoda Garden toy: a dark washed pad on Am9, Fmaj7, Cmaj7 and G6, four bars each at
# 60 BPM, music-box bells picked from each chord, a glass pad and a Rhodes in the middle, and the
# style's bed of air. Made to loop: it ends on G6, which leads back into Am9.
# chords: Am9 Am9 Am9 Am9 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 G6 G6 G6 G6
# chords @17: Am9 Am9 Am9 Am9 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 G6 G6 G6 G6
# chords @33: Am9 Am9 Am9 Am9 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 G6 G6 G6 G6
# chords @49: Am9 Am9 Am9 Am9 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 G6 G6 G6 G6
# chords @65: Am9 Am9 Am9 Am9 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 G6 G6 G6 G6
# chords @81: Am9 Am9 Am9 Am9 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 G6 G6 G6 G6
# chords @97: Am9 Am9 Am9 Am9 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Fmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 Cmaj7 G6 G6 G6 G6
# Form 1-16: open - the pad and a few bells
# Form 17-48: bells - music-box bells over the pad and sub
# Form 49-80: glass - glass pad and Rhodes join
# Form 81-112: settle - the glass pad and Rhodes drop away
title: Temple Bells
composer: Claude & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
style: ambient
key: A minor
tempo: 60
time: 4/4
about: Evening at a hillside temple: a dark pad turning slowly through four chords, bells picked out of each one, and a hush of air. Loops cleanly; turn on repeat for endless play.

